		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Floating, spherical, chitinous bugs with a dozen lizard-like eyes and tendrils trailing underneath. \"Goreweavers\" create tunnels from a sticky mixture of bile and blood.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +5 (2d6) and 2 tendrils +5 (1d6) or 1 bloodspray, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bloodspray</strong>. Fills a near-sized cube extending from ghorazagh. DEX 15+ or stuck and cannot move for 1d4 rounds. Pheromones Communicate basic information via pheromones to ghorazagh within distant.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
